The cause of death was yet to be officially established. The Himalayan Times said an initial assessment suggested he suffered a heart attack.

Mountaineers at the Khumbu Glacier during their ascend to Mount Everest's summit in Nepal ( AFP/Getty )

Lau’s family has been informed. A helicopter has been mobilised to recover his body, but poor weather and mountain conditions have hampered the operation.

